  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Hub\n\t\tCapium Hub Client Information\n\n### How does a Client User change their password?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 27 May, 2021 at 10:36 AM\n\n\t\tPlease click here to watch how to change your password as a client user\n\nLocation: My Admin > Profile > Profile Settings \n\nTo change your password whilst already logged into to your account, head to My Admin\n\nThis is the person icon in the top right hand corner\n\nYou will then enter into an admin portal\n\nPlease click on profile on the left hand side, please then click on change password\n\nPlease type in the original password given to you by your accountant\n\nPlease type in a new password, confirm the password and click save.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117301\">Capium Hub</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000195364\">Capium Hub Client Information</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How does a Client User change their password?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 27 May, 2021 at 10:36 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/b73e2806d2414dd18fb81f6c57df0292\">Please click here to watch how to change your password as a client user</a></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"198\" style='box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>Location:</strong><span style='color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;'> My Admin &gt; Profile &gt; Profile Settings</span> </p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span style='color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;'>To change your password whilst already logged into to your account, head to </span><a data-identifyelement=\"205\" href=\"https://app.capium.com/accountant/settings/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style='box-sizing: border-box;  color: rgb(44, 92, 197); text-decoration: none; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;' target=\"_blank\">My Admin</a></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This is the person icon in the top right hand corner<br><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9130751922/original/vtEOIxOxB7YfvS8Pi9339cPOScOXFw5fRA.png?1622107878\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9130751922\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You will then enter into an admin portal</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please click on profile on the left hand side, please then click on change password</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9130752089/original/NlNaVcxM85LA_mzs41xwXnV4WHKygnC4zA.png?1622108010\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9130752089\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please type in the original password given to you by your accountant</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please type in a new password, confirm the password and click save.</p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000202683\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000202683/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000202683\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000202683/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000202683\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-cont